      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t save any space.  And in the patchset, configs[] is only filled with children that specify enum-name, but gpio_inactive[] is setup for all children.\n\nIt\u0027s cleaner to just add the bool struct gpio_config.\n\nIf you really want save the space, then your gpio_inactive[] array could store the dev handle of each inactive GPIO.  You can the use a lookup routine to walk the full gpio_inactive[] looking for a match.\n\nThis might not save much code, since you need an extra function.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 53,
        "startChar": 0,
